{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14214480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14214480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1421448001:0":{"text":"狂热的人群犹如潮水般涌上前来，甚至连还在等候治疗的病患都混杂其中。","source_cn":"狂热的人群犹如潮水般涌上前来，甚至连还在等候治疗的病患...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E6B2566FBCA582","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"狂热的人群犹如潮水般涌上前来，甚至连还在等候治疗的病患都混杂其中。","female":"狂热的人群犹如潮水般涌上前来，甚至连还在等候治疗的病患都混杂其中。","variant_male_record_index":"162807","variant_female_record_index":"162808","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421448002:1":{"text":"喂，你们退后！冷静些！","source_cn":"喂，你们退后！冷静些！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01B33F0D9D2BEC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421448003:1":{"text":"是因度厄大人！多亏了您，我才能获得自由！","source_cn":"是因度厄大人！多亏了您，我才能获得自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63E03F812270A26F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421448004:1":{"text":"不用客气。你的身体……","source_cn":"不用客气。你的身体……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868967DD6C22E00C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421448005:1":{"text":"所以，您需要侍奉的人吗？我听说了，您现在身边没有别人！","source_cn":"所以，您需要侍奉的人吗？我听说了，您现在身边没有别人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0254C79502FF6380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421448006:1":{"text":"……啊？","source_cn":"……啊？<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257152F529AD08CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421448007:2":{"text":"让开，让开！沙利叶大人，是我呀，沙利叶大人！","source_cn":"让开，让开！沙利叶大人，是我呀，沙利叶大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87EA4B5040C0F92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421448008:1":{"text":"沙利叶大人，以前多亏了您的庇护，我的珠宝生意才能维持！","source_cn":"沙利叶大人，以前多亏了您的庇护，我的珠宝生意才能维持！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64F423723A07A73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421448009:1":{"text":"但那些该死的新卫队，那些泥腿子，他们居然没收了我的财产——","source_cn":"但那些该死的新卫队，那些泥腿子，他们居然没收了我的财产——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2C51E26073009C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421448010:1":{"text":"我们不会无缘无故地没收正当的财——\n喂，别推了！","source_cn":"我们不会无缘无故地没收正当的财——\\n喂，别推了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79EA6E3095857ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1